<title>SINGAPORE: Showpla Asia 1996 net profit up 7.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Showpla Asia 1996 net profit up 7.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   4.17   vs    3.89</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	  8.00   vs    8.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	5.21   vs     n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover		   129.87   vs  110.89</p>
<p>    Associates		   0.78   vs    0.37</p>
<p>    Other/interest income    1.51   vs    0.57</p>
<p>    Interest expense	   7.21   vs    5.44</p>
<p>    Depreciation		15.15   vs   12.32</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     8.03   vs    5.75</p>
<p>    Tax			    2.07   vs    1.01</p>
<p>Note - Showpla Asia Ltd is involved in the manufacture of plastics, moulding dies and tools.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
